            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Here are the missing villagers — in chains! Would this have been our fate if not for your intervention, Diondra?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("I think the prisoners are being forced to... dive for pearls? But there aren’t any pearls on this part of the coast."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Diondra",
            text: _("Perhaps this is not the slaves’ final home. A grim omen. It sounds almost as if they mean to conquer the Bay of Pearls itself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Is that possible?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Diondra",
            text: _("My city nurtures the continent’s largest and wealthiest merfolk population, yet most of us are not warriors. With Wesnoth’s army away at war in the east, I think it unlikely but not impossible for a coordinated group of corsairs to take control."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("An invading army. And our neighbors enslaved! We can’t abide this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Grab your weapons, everyone. Free every prisoner... but take none ourselves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "cages",
            kill: "no",
            type: "Cage",
          },
        ],
      },
